{"symbol":"KENVI","yahoo":"KENVI.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"name":"Kenvi Jewels Limited","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Luxury Goods","website":"https://www.kenvijewels.com","about":"Kenvi Jewels Limited engages in the designing, manufacturing, retailing, wholesaling, and trading of jewelries under the Suvarnakrupa brand in India. It offers wedding and festive jewelry, rings, chains, earrings, ear chains, nose-rings/nose pins, waist belts, mangalsutras, anklets, zudas, toe rings, pendant sets/pendants, bracelets, and bangles; and lucky, pendal sets, dokiyas, brooches, bajubandhs, cufflinks, kadas, watches, and mix ornaments. the company is involved in trading of gold jewellery. It also sells its products online. The company was incorporated in 2013 and is based in Ahmedabad, India.","updated":"2026-09-26T06:34:33+00:00","quote":{"price":1.96,"prevClose":1.93,"marketCap":24.77,"high52":3.63,"low52":1.64,"pe":21.78,"bookValue":0.94,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":null,"shares":12.638,"insiders":65.62,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2018-02-16","2018-02-19","2018-02-20","2018-02-21","2018-02-22","2018-02-23","2018-02-26","2018-02-27","2018-02-28","2018-03-01","2018-03-05","2018-03-06","2018-03-07","2018-03-08","2018-03-09","2018-03-12","2018-03-13","2018-03-14","2018-03-15","2018-03-16","2018-03-19","2018-03-20","2018-03-21","2018-03-22","2018-03-23","2018-03-26","2018-03-27","2018-03-28","2018-04-02","2018-04-03","2018-04-04","2018-04-05","2018-04-06","2018-04-09","2018-04-10","2018-04-11","2018-04-12","2018-04-13","2018-04-16","2018-04-17","2018-04-18","2018-04-19","2018-04-20","2018-04-23","2018-04-24","2018-04-25","2018-04-26","2018-04-27","2018-04-30","2018-05-02","2018-05-03","2018-05-04","2018-05-07","2018-05-08","2018-05-09","2018-05-10","2018-05-11","2018-05-14","2018-05-15","2018-05-16","2018-05-17","2018-05-18","2018-05-21","2018-05-22","2018-05-23","2018-05-24","2018-05-25","2018-05-28","2018-05-29","2018-05-30","2018-05-31","2018-06-01","2018-0